<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-066" chapter-id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong" source-id="s-songshu-066-wangjinghong">
  <p id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAA">王敬弘</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。與<persName id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:p001:m0012" ref="3dv_ken_w58">高祖</persName>諱同，故稱字。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:p001:m0023" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDA">廙</persName>，晉驃騎將軍。祖<persName id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:p001:m0032" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDAB">胡之</persName>，司州刺史。父<persName id="c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:p001:m0041" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDABA">茂之</persName>，晉陵太守。</p>
</text>
